attempts.raw:
@start **The window opens on a spine.** Columns 0 to 10, `sseA` to `der`, are carried by 93 to 100% of chromosomes, all persistent, in a region of plasticity in 0 to 5% of calls {S1, P}. The model names 95 to 100% of them, fewest at column 3, `ndk`, 95% {S1}.

@variable **A fork follows at column 11**, `yfgJ`, carried by 67%, the stretch most in regions of plasticity, 22% {S2, P}. Then the spine of columns 12 to 18, `xseA` to a hypothetical protein, carried by 93 to 95% {S3}. Through columns 35 to 37 a branch of 3 shell families runs in 10 to 11%, [[terminase]] {S6.b35, Q}.

@model **The model names more genes on the spine columns than on the fork and variable ones**, 94 against 91%, and hesitates less there, 0.27 against 0.42 bits {M}. It hesitates most at column 38, `hyfD`, a variable column, 0.85 bits {H}.

@end **The window ends in the `eut` genes**, columns 62 to 65, [[ethanolamine utilization acetate kinase]] {S6.c62-65, Q}. The last column is `ypeA`, in 32% of chromosomes {E}.

@whole **Across the window it names 92% of genes**, 0.37 bits on average, perplexity 1.5 families {G}. Inside a region of plasticity it hesitates more than outside, 1.14 against 0.16 bits, and names fewer genes, 70% against 98% {C}.

